1
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,599
Rongcheng is crisscrossed with waterways,

2
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,879
where drownings were frequent in ancient times,

3
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:42,159
and ghostly legends spread among the folk.

4
00:01:43,159 --> 00:01:44,680
As recorded in Stories of Mindu:

5
00:01:45,079 --> 00:01:46,400
It resembles an ape,

6
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:49,159
lurking underwater to drown victims,

7
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,400
and hiding away in caves.

8
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:53,560
Locals commonly call it the Water ghost.

9
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:56,599
Thus, whenever strange occurrences arise,

10
00:01:56,879 --> 00:01:59,159
the people make offerings to the Sea Goddess

11
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,560
to ward off disaster and misfortune.

12
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,520
Ghost!

13
00:02:48,639 --> 00:02:50,719
It's the Water ghost! The ghost did this!

14
00:02:51,199 --> 00:02:51,879
Stand back! Step back!

15
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,800
Don't disturb the crime scene!

16
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:54,759
Notify the police station.

17
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,159
Take the body back for an autopsy.

18
00:02:56,319 --> 00:02:56,840
No!

19
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,120
Our bodies are given by our parents.

20
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:00,719
They cannot be harmed.

21
00:03:01,039 --> 00:03:01,639
Village Chief,

22
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,400
only an autopsy can determine the cause of death

23
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,599
and help us catch the killer.

24
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:05,800
Enough!

25
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:06,800
What parents

26
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:07,840
would want to see their child

27
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:08,840
cut wide open?

28
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,240
Village Chief...

29
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:10,680
That's enough!

30
00:03:10,919 --> 00:03:11,759
Without my permission,

31
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,080
no one touches him!

32
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,120
What's the status of the bodies?

33
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,479
The victims are all male.

34
00:03:35,919 --> 00:03:37,039
All around 30 years old.

35
00:03:37,439 --> 00:03:38,319
All died from drowning.

36
00:03:38,759 --> 00:03:39,439
Dull complexions,

37
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,319
yellowed teeth...

38
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,000
They were drug addicts.

39
00:03:41,599 --> 00:03:42,719
All their chests were cut open,

40
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,680
with internal organs completely gone.

41
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,560
The Ocean Sigil forehead cuts are narrow.

42
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,000
The weapon was likely a rare, thin awl.

43
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,120
Time of death?

44
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,639
Based on the level of decomposition,

45
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:53,080
roughly three days ago.

46
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,000
June 17.

47
00:03:55,199 --> 00:03:56,120
There's a light in the cave.

48
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,240
Let's check it out.

49
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,520
Split up! You go this way!

50
00:03:58,639 --> 00:03:59,039
Got it!

51
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,039
After them!

52
00:04:08,719 --> 00:04:09,400
Freeze!

53
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,720
Why were you on the Langqi Island coast?

54
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:34,519
I'm thirsty. I want jasmine tea.

55
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:35,959
Who do you think you are?

56
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,040
This is the police station,

57
00:05:37,319 --> 00:05:38,160
not your home.

58
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,040
Pour the tea.

59
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:41,639
Master...

60
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,519
Go.

61
00:05:43,439 --> 00:05:43,920
Yes, sir.

62
00:05:55,319 --> 00:05:56,000
Answer the question.

63
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,600
Just having some fun.

64
00:05:58,199 --> 00:05:59,720
Going swimming dressed in all black...

65
00:06:00,519 --> 00:06:01,319
nothing wrong with that, right?

66
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:02,759
Why did you come after me?

67
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,560
Thought you were a Water ghost.

68
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:06,600
Just tried to catch one.

69
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,800
You're the only suspect in this case.

70
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,040
I suggest you come clean.

71
00:06:15,319 --> 00:06:16,279
Fished out from the seabed.

72
00:06:19,879 --> 00:06:21,120
The Ocean Sigil forehead cuts are narrow.

73
00:06:21,759 --> 00:06:23,680
The murder weapon is likely a rare, thin awl.

74
00:06:24,759 --> 00:06:25,600
Send it to forensics for examination.

75
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,439
Yes, Master.

76
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:30,040
On the night of the crime,

77
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:31,920
I was with the Sanshan Gang brothers,

78
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,160
drinking heavily at Hua Moli.

79
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:35,199
All my brothers can vouch for me.

80
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:37,480
I'm not the killer.

81
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,800
Can you let me go now?

82
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,600
Boss Chen!

83
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:56,879
May your business thrive!

84
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,480
Thank you for the kind words.

85
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:00,800
Boss Chen!

86
00:07:00,879 --> 00:07:01,360
May business be booming!

87
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,120
Wishing you good business!

88
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,120
Thank you!

89
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:20,040
Boss Chen

90
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,000
At this time of day,

91
00:07:43,279 --> 00:07:45,560
shouldn't you be overseeing port cargo?

92
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:47,680
How do you have time to visit me?

93
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:50,800
There was a murder at Sea Goddess Temple.

94
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,560
Most of the victims were fishermen.

95
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:54,519
I went to investigate,

96
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,240
but couldn't find a single lead.

97
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,959
Dance halls attract all sorts of people.

98
00:08:00,199 --> 00:08:00,720
Dieyi,

99
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,240
you're better informed than I am.

100
00:08:02,759 --> 00:08:03,480
Help me ask around.

101
00:08:05,879 --> 00:08:08,040
You're not related to them at all.

102
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:09,720
Why wade into these muddy waters?

103
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,240
What concerns the fishermen

104
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,439
concerns our Sanshan Gang.

105
00:08:17,279 --> 00:08:18,639
And what concerns the Sanshan Gang

106
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:20,439
concerns me.

107
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,399
Having tasted so many,

108
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:31,560
your jasmine tea is the most authentic.

109
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,600
Take a look. Is this yours?

110
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,000
It's mine.

111
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:42,440
My mother's eyesight is poor,

112
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:43,679
but she likes mending shoes.

113
00:08:44,399 --> 00:08:45,840
I asked Old Li at the blacksmith shop

114
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:46,840
to forge one specially for her,

115
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,799
a handy awl.

116
00:08:48,799 --> 00:08:49,799
Why is it with you?

117
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,480
Forensic examination confirmed

118
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:55,120
this awl matches the weapon that carved

119
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:57,919
the forehead Ocean Sigils on the victims.

120
00:08:58,759 --> 00:09:00,120
Come on, Officer Li.

121
00:09:00,799 --> 00:09:03,159
Are you treating me like the real killer?

122
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:06,120
Where were you on the night of June 17th?

123
00:09:06,919 --> 00:09:08,159
I was on patrol.

124
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,120
Our Shipboard Guild

125
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,519
has always been responsible for

126
00:09:11,519 --> 00:09:13,519
coastal security on Langqi Island.

127
00:09:14,559 --> 00:09:15,440
The awl is mine,

128
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,120
but I lost it a while ago

129
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,840
and never found it.

130
00:09:19,519 --> 00:09:22,639
Besides, nobody saw me hurt anyone with it.

131
00:09:23,399 --> 00:09:26,679
So I'm not the real killer.

132
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:31,600
Master, Deputy Director Zhou wants you.

133
00:09:32,159 --> 00:09:32,879
Got it.

134
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:44,080
Heard you caught Shipboard Guild's Shen?

135
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,200
Yes, sir.

136
00:09:45,759 --> 00:09:47,919
And Sanshan Gang's Master Lian yesterday?

137
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,440
Yes, sir.

138
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,159
Mingyuan, oh Mingyuan...

139
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:56,440
I know you want to solve the case quickly,

140
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:58,360
but if you keep handling it like this,

141
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,279
our police station

142
00:09:59,279 --> 00:10:01,080
will offend every gang in Rongcheng!

143
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,320
The Sanshan Gang

144
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:04,600
is tied to 10,000 Rongcheng fishermen.

145
00:10:05,039 --> 00:10:05,879
And as for the Shipboard Guild,

146
00:10:06,159 --> 00:10:08,639
they handle import and export shipping,

147
00:10:08,879 --> 00:10:10,519
dealing closely with foreign chambers.

148
00:10:11,159 --> 00:10:13,600
Think carefully when investigating a case!

149
00:10:15,159 --> 00:10:15,759
Listen to me.

150
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:16,960
Release them immediately.

151
00:10:17,399 --> 00:10:19,240
No. Shen Tieshan is a prime suspect.

152
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:20,200
The murder weapon belongs to him,

153
00:10:20,399 --> 00:10:20,840
and at the time of the crime, he was—

154
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:22,039
Chairman Sun of the Shipboard Guild

155
00:10:22,039 --> 00:10:23,440
has already called me.

156
00:10:23,799 --> 00:10:25,320
If they file a joint complaint against us,

157
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:27,120
even the Chief will be held accountable.

158
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:28,639
Mingyuan,

159
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:29,960
do as I say.

160
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,360
Yes, sir.

161
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,600
You had Bailing call me over so urgently.

162
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:43,080
Got news about the Sea Goddess Temple?

163
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:46,200
Shipboard Guild men drank here last night

164
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,200
and let something slip.

165
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,559
They mentioned Water ghosts and such,

166
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,720
and said someone escaped that night.

167
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:52,080
A guy with a red, pockmarked face.

168
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,080
Catch him, and the case will be solved.

169
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,039
I suspect

170
00:10:58,840 --> 00:10:59,519
it's Wan Jun.

171
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:06,240
Brother Mingyuan! Brother Mingyuan!

172
00:11:07,279 --> 00:11:07,960
Wan Ting.

173
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,240
Slow down, take it easy.

174
00:11:11,039 --> 00:11:11,919
What happened? Tell me.

175
00:11:11,919 --> 00:11:12,679
My brother, Wan Jun,

176
00:11:12,679 --> 00:11:14,200
ever since the Sea Goddess Temple murders,

177
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:15,480
hasn't come home at all.

178
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,120
Tell me the details.

179
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,600
For the past six months, for some reason,

180
00:11:19,039 --> 00:11:20,720
my brother kept staying out every few days

181
00:11:21,039 --> 00:11:22,080
and stealing money from home.

182
00:11:22,279 --> 00:11:23,879
My dad got so mad he'd always beat him.

183
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,600
But at most, he'd be gone for two days.

184
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:27,000
It's already the third day,

185
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:27,879
and he's still not back.

186
00:11:29,919 --> 00:11:31,720
Where was he last seen?

187
00:11:32,639 --> 00:11:33,960
Some fishermen said they saw him

188
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:37,080
on Yunlong Road by Langqi Beach.

189
00:11:51,279 --> 00:11:52,279
Just my luck.

190
00:11:53,799 --> 00:11:54,440
What are you doing here?

191
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,240
Looking for someone.

192
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,039
What a coincidence.

193
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:58,799
I'm looking for someone too.

194
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,759
Wan Jun and I grew up together.

195
00:12:01,759 --> 00:12:02,840
I don't have time to bicker with you.

196
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:11,519
Wan Jun!

197
00:12:14,039 --> 00:12:14,639
He's over there!

198
00:12:18,919 --> 00:12:19,480
After him!

199
00:12:20,159 --> 00:12:20,600
Freeze!

200
00:12:26,519 --> 00:12:27,240
Why did you stop?

201
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:32,519
Officer Li.

202
00:12:32,679 --> 00:12:33,600
Helmsman Shen.

203
00:12:34,399 --> 00:12:35,279
It's so late. Are you...

204
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:36,159
out on a case?

205
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:38,879
What good timing.

206
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,600
I was rude at the station last time.

207
00:12:40,799 --> 00:12:41,639
Since I'm passing by,

208
00:12:41,639 --> 00:12:42,759
let me treat you to a meal to apologize.

209
00:12:43,399 --> 00:12:43,960
That won't be necessary.

210
00:12:44,759 --> 00:12:46,080
You're not giving me face, Helmsman Shen.

211
00:12:47,679 --> 00:12:49,840
Next time. I'm busy.

212
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:50,720
Over there!

213
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:52,799
After him!

214
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,600
Stopped again? Why is it you?

215
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,039
It's Lian Ye.

216
00:13:12,559 --> 00:13:13,200
Helmsman Shen.

217
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,080
What's going on so late at night?

218
00:13:15,519 --> 00:13:16,480
Why is it you?

219
00:13:19,039 --> 00:13:19,919
Just had dinner,

220
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:20,919
out to walk it off.

221
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:22,919
Want some melon seeds?

222
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:26,679
Screw your seeds!

223
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:27,879
Keep searching!

224
00:13:28,519 --> 00:13:29,120
Yes, sir!

225
00:13:32,639 --> 00:13:33,279
Hurry up!
